      "content": "wait, \"the broader economic community\" agreeing? that sounds pretty definitive. it feels like you're saying there isn't really a serious debate about whether it helped or hurt. what about the whole thing with wealth inequality? i thought a lot of people argued that deregulation was a huge reason why the gap between rich and poor blew up.",
